  <desc id="r05-tie-description">Dale's Nov23 reference. Direct level-laser F3 finished short end to wall125.4375in. Derived F0166.0625in, F1150in, F2136.75in before gap. F0approximately166in is an angled-shot cross-check only. WallX174.8125in. F0\u2013F2 clear strips confirmed, no added profile or assembly confirmation. This reference does not override edited local inputs.</desc>
